{"html_text": {"ja198:0.1": "<article id='ja198'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja198:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja198:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja198:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja198:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja198:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja198:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja198:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja198:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja198:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja198:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja198:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja198:3.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja198:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja198:0.2": "Dukanipāta ", "ja198:0.3": "Ruhakavagga ", "ja198:0.4": "8. Rādhajātaka ", "ja198:1.1": "“Pavāsā āgato tāta, ", "ja198:1.2": "idāni nacirāgato; ", "ja198:1.3": "Kaccinnu tāta te mātā, ", "ja198:1.4": "na aññamupasevati”. ", "ja198:2.1": "“Na kho panetaṁ subhaṇaṁ, ", "ja198:2.2": "Giraṁ saccupasaṁhitaṁ; ", "ja198:2.3": "Sayetha poṭṭhapādova, ", "ja198:2.4": "Mummure upakūthito”ti. ", "ja198:3.1": "Rādhajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja198:0.1": "", "ja198:0.2": "", "ja198:0.3": "", "ja198:0.4": "", "ja198:1.1": "", "ja198:1.2": "", "ja198:1.3": "", "ja198:1.4": "", "ja198:2.1": "", "ja198:2.2": "", "ja198:2.3": "", "ja198:2.4": "Mummure → mummare (sya1ed, sya2ed); maṁ pure (mr) | upakūthito”ti → upakūsitoti (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1); upakūlito (mr) ", "ja198:3.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja198:0.1": "", "ja198:0.2": "", "ja198:0.3": "", "ja198:0.4": "", "ja198:1.1": "ms22J_491, msdiv95, pts-vp-pli2.133", "ja198:1.2": "", "ja198:1.3": "", "ja198:1.4": "", "ja198:2.1": "bj30.92, ms22J_492, msdiv96, pts-vp-pli2.134", "ja198:2.2": "", "ja198:2.3": "", "ja198:2.4": "", "ja198:3.1": "ms22J_493"}, "keys_order": ["ja198:0.1", "ja198:0.2", "ja198:0.3", "ja198:0.4", "ja198:1.1", "ja198:1.2", "ja19